    "functions": {
      "type": "orlant-functions",
      "blocks": {
        "fn_airflow": {
          "type": "function",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/orlant-fn-airflow.jpg",
            "icon": "wind",
            "eyebrow": "Rapid drying",
            "heading": "Hot and cold airflow, alternating",
            "text": "<p>Alternating hot and cold circulating airflow works through layered fabrics to clear residual dampness. EC cross-flow blowers move the air while PTC heaters warm it.</p>",
            "requires": "none",
            "figure_1_value": "Up to 6",
            "figure_1_label": "EC cross-flow blowers",
            "figure_2_value": "4",
            "figure_2_label": "PTC heaters"
          }
        },
        "fn_ec_motor": {
          "type": "function",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/orlant-fn-ec-motor.jpg",
            "icon": "quiet",
            "eyebrow": "EC motor",
            "heading": "Strong airflow, low noise",
            "text": "<p>An energy-efficient EC motor sits in a precision die-cast aluminium frame. Anti-vibration rubber damping pads and a balanced dual-section fan give high airflow with minimal wind noise.</p>",
            "requires": "none"
          }
        },
        "fn_uv_ioniser": {
          "type": "function",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/orlant-fn-uv-ioniser.jpg",
            "icon": "sparkle",
            "eyebrow": "Hygiene",
            "heading": "UV disinfection and ioniser",
            "text": "<p>On the M5 and M6, UV disinfection and a negative-ion ioniser work on the load while it dries. The D6 has the ioniser.</p>",
            "requires": "sterilisation"
          }
        },
        "fn_poles": {
          "type": "function",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/orlant-fn-poles.jpg",
            "icon": "rails",
            "eyebrow": "Drying space",
            "heading": "Full-span telescopic poles",
            "text": "<p>Every drying arm, including the central supporting frames, extends fully and at the same time, so the weight spreads evenly across the rack.</p>",
            "requires": "none",
            "figure_1_value": "Up to 2300 mm",
            "figure_1_label": "Pole reach",
            "figure_2_value": "Up to 7",
            "figure_2_label": "Poles"
          }
        },
        "fn_lifting": {
          "type": "function",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/orlant-fn-lifting.jpg",
            "icon": "lift",
            "eyebrow": "Lifting",
            "heading": "Smooth, quiet lifting",
            "text": "<p>A precision-wound DC brush motor lifts the rack smoothly under its full rated load. Multi-layer noise reduction keeps it quiet day and night, with minimal routine maintenance.</p>",
            "requires": "none",
            "figure_1_value": "62 dB(A)",
            "figure_1_label": "Operating noise",
            "figure_2_value": "5 years",
            "figure_2_label": "Motor warranty"
          }
        },
        "fn_protection": {
          "type": "function",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/orlant-fn-protection.jpg",
            "icon": "shield",
            "eyebrow": "Safety",
            "heading": "Overweight alarm and resistance protection",
            "text": "<p>An alarm sounds when the load goes over the rack's limit: 55 kg on the M6, 45 kg on the M5 and D6. Bidirectional resistance protection guards the rack as it travels up and down.</p>",
            "requires": "bidirectional_protection",
            "figure_1_value": "55 kg",
            "figure_1_label": "Maximum load, M6",
            "figure_2_value": "45 kg",
            "figure_2_label": "M5 and D6"
          }
        },
        "fn_ultra_thin": {
          "type": "function",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/orlant-fn-ultra-thin.jpg",
            "icon": "thin",
            "eyebrow": "Design",
            "heading": "15 cm ultra-thin body",
            "text": "<p>Retracted, the M6 is just 15 cm deep. It sits flush against the ceiling and keeps overhead space free in small balconies and service yards.</p>",
            "requires": "ultra_thin_cm",
            "figure_1_value": "15 cm",
            "figure_1_label": "Retracted depth"
          }
        },
        "fn_cables": {
          "type": "function",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/orlant-fn-cables.jpg",
            "icon": "cable",
            "eyebrow": "Built to last",
            "heading": "Marine-grade 304 stainless steel cables",
            "text": "<p>Core cables and hardware use marine-grade 304 stainless steel, lab-tested against Singapore's monsoon rain, coastal salt spray and year-round humidity. Each cable is a 49-strand bundle around a sealed, self-lubricating core, so it never needs oiling.</p>",
            "requires": "none",
            "figure_1_value": "304",
            "figure_1_label": "Stainless steel",
            "figure_2_value": "49",
            "figure_2_label": "Strands per cable"
          }
        },
        "fn_app_voice": {
          "type": "function",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/orlant-fn-app-voice.jpg",
            "icon": "phone",
            "eyebrow": "Smart control",
            "heading": "Control it from your phone",
            "text": "<p>Raise, lower and switch functions from the Orlant app, wherever you are. The M6 also takes voice commands.</p>",
            "requires": "app_control"
          }
        },
        "fn_led": {
          "type": "function",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/orlant-fn-led.jpg",
            "icon": "bulb",
            "eyebrow": "Lighting",
            "heading": "Built-in LED panel light",
            "text": "<p>Every model has an LED panel light built in, so the yard is lit while you hang and collect the laundry. The M6's panel is 3-tone.</p>",
            "requires": "led_panel"
          }
        }
